1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
這是本次真實 CLI 紀錄的字幕版；尚未配音。
Captioned recording of the real run. No narration has been generated.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:25,000
先預檢再建立；setup 不會自動進入第一步。
Preflight, create, and verify. Setup does not start the research workflow.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:37,000
建立了 11 個檔案；路徑由 config 解析。
Setup created 11 files. Canonical paths are resolved from config.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:50,000
題目先保留「波動」的模糊處，讓流程真的追問。
The initial idea leaves volatility ambiguous so the skill must clarify it.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:01,000
TWSE 三個月份共 56 個交易日；資料取得不等於實證完成。
The three TWSE months contain 56 trading days. Data access is not analysis.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:20,000
先決定構念；模型的建議仍要檢查，稍後收緊測量界限。
Define the construct first. We will tighten the proxy’s limits later.

7
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:34,000
選日內幅度代理，限制在描述性關聯；不做因果。
The demo researcher chooses an intraday-range proxy and a descriptive claim.

8
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:47,000
選擇與理由留在決策檔，不只停在對話。
The choice and its rationale are stored in the actual decision record.

9
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:58,000
第一步仍 partial；明確要求產生 conditional 設計草稿。
Step 1 remains partial. The researcher explicitly requests a conditional draft.

10
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:13,000
這是真實檔案；沒有把未完成的工作寫成 ready。
This is the actual Brief file. Unfinished work is not marked ready.

11
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:27,000
方法尚未執行；只能描述共同變動，不能做因果推論。
The methods are unexecuted. Co-movement does not establish causation.

12
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:37,000
選配和核心使用同一個 harness 與安裝位置。
The optional profile uses the same harness and target as the core.

13
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:47,000
核心仍是 42；finance-social-science 另新增 1。
The core stays at 42 skills; the optional profile adds one.

14
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:58,000
檢查描述性設計的效度，不硬加因果模型。
Audit the descriptive design without imposing a causal model.

15
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:20,000
判定 repair：公司行動、價量口徑與原始快照都還有缺口。
Verdict: repair. Corporate actions, scope alignment, and snapshots need work.

16
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:33,000
不報 p 值、不事後刪特殊日；仍不計算實證結果。
No p-values or post-hoc deletion of special days; no empirical results are computed.

17
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:54,000
補單位、口徑、推論邊界；v0.2 仍是 conditional，尚未重審。
Units, scope, and inference limits are revised. Version 0.2 remains conditional.

18
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:08,000
只完成資料取得與格式核對；原始資料的再發布授權仍未核對。
Only acquisition and format checks are complete. Redistribution rights remain unverified.

19
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:17,000
只回讀索引、claims 與必要狀態，不自動推進。
Read the index and claims; do not advance the workflow.

20
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:34,000
有審查檔，不代表已到第六步；取得資料不代表完成研究。
A review file does not mean Step 6 is complete; data acquisition is not study completion.

21
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:44,000
本片是研究設計實操；沒有因果、預測或投資結論。
This is a research-design walkthrough, with no causal, predictive, or investment conclusions.
